videovigilance
==============

The videovigilance module of the Tryton application platform.

Installing
----------

See INSTALL

Detection service
-----------------

The detection service sends events, heartbeats and video to Tryton through HTTP routes
authenticated with a key of the *Videovigilància: servei de detecció* user application. See
doc/service_api.md.


